BT /F1 10 Tf 72 686.0 Td (Backpropagation computes the gradient of the loss function with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 672.0 Td (respect to every weight in the network by applying the chain rule) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 658.0 Td (backwards through each layer in turn. The algorithm is what makes) Tj ET
